 "note": "Export after switching on the four routines for the canary (register R-AN-61, §16.18 A6, A7 and A9). raw = the RemoteTrigger update responses that switched analyst-w1, analyst-w2, analyst-lesson and analyst-revision on (2026-10-26 04:41:40Z to 04:41:43Z) and the RemoteTrigger get of analyst-probe (after C20 run 4), with the creator's account fields left out. The updates set only enabled: true; every response shows mcp_connections [] and enabled_plugins [], so no connector or plugin is attached. project: null for every routine; no response has a field whose name contains project, and the routines were created and updated only with RemoteTrigger (created_via http_api), never from a claude.ai project. Prompts are unchanged (prompt_sha256 equal to the previous export). Environment gold-analyst (env_01REwcJo2NSGXn64reopcvds) read in its dialog at claude.ai/code on 2026-10-26 between 04:20Z and 04:43Z: network access None (no allowed domain, so the package-manager list is off), one network secret for api.twelvedata.com (type Bearer, header Authorization, prefix apikey, value pasted by the owner from the macOS keychain item twelvedata-api-key; the list shows no Not sent marker, and C20 run 4 reached Twelve Data with HTTP 200 through it), no setup script, no environment variables. analyst-probe keeps its placeholder yearly cron and stays disabled: it is fired with run-now only. | Re-export 2026-10-27T22:36:26Z for register §16.18 A14 (R-AN-61): adds analyst-wake, created by the owner through the API at 2026-10-27T17:19:51Z with the same environment, repository, model, tools and prompt as analyst-w1 and no schedule (crons []); claude.ai attached every account connector at creation and the owner cleared them at 17:19:53Z (clear_mcp_connections); the client added its API trigger and token in claude.ai at 22:29:03Z. Its raw is the RemoteTrigger get of about 22:34Z with the creator's account fields left out and api_token_hint replaced (the hint of a live token is not published); mcp_connections [] and enabled_plugins []. The other five entries and the environment block are carried from the 2026-10-26 export unchanged: a RemoteTrigger list at about 22:35Z shows their updated_at unchanged since that export (analyst-w1..revision 2026-10-26T04:41:40Z..04:41:43Z, analyst-probe 2026-10-24) with no connector or plugin, and the environment was not edited since its 2026-10-26 reading. The account's other routines (wake-test, disabled, to be deleted by the client; dukascopy-diagnostic, disabled) run nothing for the analyst.",
