   "note": "Register R-AN-61 and §16.18 A9 (decision A9-D11): access level None, no allowed domain, the default package-manager list off. The GitHub proxy (serving only the attached inbox), the Anthropic API and the hosts of a network secret stay reachable at every level. The session steps import only the standard library and analyst/vendor (tests/test_layout.py), so no package install is needed. Disclosed: through the inbox's webhooks GitHub itself can still reach any address for a session (R-AN-75 item 2); no network setting closes that. Since §16.18 A7 the session guard (.claude/hooks/guard.py, R-AN-85) refuses every call that could create one, and the run-log scan (R-AN-86) and the security log (R-AN-60) detect what it could miss."
